{"id": 89, "name": "Wanwan", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/8/8f/Hero891-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20250117142006", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Burst"], "difficulty": "60", "stats": ["20", "60", "30", "60"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "The Agile Tiger of the Oriental Fighters and a lively young girl who wields the Crossbow of Tang.", "skills": [{"name": "Tiger Pace", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_78599b839d691545f6b6be60226bbed4.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Enemy heroes hit by Wanwan's attacks will have their weaknesses and positions exposed for 5s. When hitting an enemy's weakness, Wanwan deals 67(+3*Hero Level) extra <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span> and increases their damage taken from her subsequent attacks by 10% for 5s.\nWanwan can dash a short distance after each arrow fired from her Basic Attack. The dash speed scales with her Attack Speed."}, {"name": "Swallow’s Path", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_283d9308b3df76c466b2f254a388f8dd.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 85", "desc": "Wanwan throws a Fire Swallow in the target direction, triggering <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Tiger Pace</span> while dealing 120<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in its path. The Fire Swallow then turns into 3 rotating Swallow Daggers. After a short delay, these Swallow Daggers will fly back to Wanwan one after another, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies on their way back and slowing them by 30% for 1.5s. Enemies hit twice by the Swallow Daggers will be immobilized for 0.5s."}, {"name": "Needles in Flowers", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_790a739ceca6895fcaafd3df4514e9e1.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 64, "tagname": "Remove CC", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 24   Mana Cost: 125", "desc": "Wanwan removes all control effects on herself and triggers <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Tiger Pace</span>. Meanwhile, she shoots Deadly Needles in all directions, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit."}, {"name": "Crossbow of Tang", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5f9cc5433feeefb499219539f7c1e62f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Wanwan leaps into the air and becomes untargetable, firing arrows at the target enemy hero for 2.5s in rapid succession, dealing 60<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+35% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> per arrow. If the target is killed during this attack, Wanwan will switch to another enemy hero in her attack range, gain 30% Attack Speed, and extend the skill duration by 1s (this effect can trigger up to 3 times). Wanwan can trigger <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Tiger Pace</span> upon killing an enemy and at the end of the duration.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Crossbow of Tang</span> can only be cast on enemy heroes with all their weaknesses hit and Wanwan gains 100% Movement Speed during the duration. This damage is regarded as Basic Attack damage, and the firing rate scales with Wanwan's Attack Speed."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a